@page "/"

<PageTitle>RedbIdentityApp</PageTitle>

<h1>RedbIdentityApp</h1>

<p>
    An application on redb.Identity. You sign in at Identity; this server keeps your session and calls the
    application's module with your access token. The module checks every token with Identity.
</p>

<AuthorizeView>
    <Authorized>
        <p>Signed in as <strong>@context.User.Identity?.Name</strong>. Open your <a href="notes">notes</a>.</p>
    </Authorized>
    <NotAuthorized>
        <p><a href="account/login" data-enhance-nav="false">Sign in</a> to see your notes.</p>
    </NotAuthorized>
</AuthorizeView>
